{"time": 1774176138, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1149047992", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "（没事45约等于50约等于100了）"}
{"time": 1774176177, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1926573513", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "土坡上的动静越来越大，等近了你们才发现那是从山上携势而下的山体滑坡，并且不幸的是就算司机踩紧了油门，你们的车仍然被冲击了车的尾端"}
{"time": 1774176217, "type": "recv", "message_id": "678386649", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "但是幸运的是，追着你们的那辆白色警车被正好击中了"}
{"time": 1774176268, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1487672395", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "突如其来的冲击使你们的车停了下来，无法再启动"}
{"time": 1774176283, "type": "recv", "message_id": "439044641", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（滑坡停了？）"}
{"time": 1774176290, "type": "recv", "message_id": "861816176", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“气运流转，看来我们命不该绝”扶着锅，头探出车窗，朝后方看去"}
{"time": 1774176296, "type": "recv", "message_id": "133692159", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（就这一波）"}
{"time": 1774176311, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1859127484", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“呼~”"}
{"time": 1774176332, "type": "recv", "message_id": "835485980", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“只是，我们接下来难道要步行逃离吗？”"}
{"time": 1774176344, "type": "recv", "message_id": "268591338", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“去你妈的条子”往后竖了一个中指"}
{"time": 1774176358, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1608987828", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "#陪一根"}
{"time": 1774176370, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1539641724", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "然后打开出门，下车一脚踢了下车门"}
{"time": 1774176375, "type": "recv", "message_id": "844938834", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“这车也是破”"}
{"time": 1774176376, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1994501503", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "现在你们身处山林间，后方的山路已经出现了一定程度的坍塌，20 米开外的位置可见侧翻的白色警车，车身小部分掩埋在泥土里，而前方的山路则看起来尚且完好，头顶偶有闷雷作响，雨势仍然不减"}
{"time": 1774176382, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1848178337", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "检视一下表盘，发现汽车熄火，无力的靠在车座，抽根烟缓缓劲。"}
{"time": 1774176397, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1646108916", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "看向这四周的环境，“现在咋搞”"}
{"time": 1774176417, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1067150219", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "“不晓得”"}
{"time": 1774176463, "type": "recv", "message_id": "395904639", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "“找哈附近有没有村子吧，好歹得回到文明社会”"}
{"time": 1774176465, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1145836738", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "检查后面的路可否供人通过"}
{"time": 1774176482, "type": "recv", "message_id": "723408419", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "对着滑坡处合掌作揖:“虽然被你们追了一路，但希望你们不会命丧于此”"}
{"time": 1774176516, "type": "recv", "message_id": "757152418", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "接下来的路虽然泥泞，至少是能走人的"}
{"time": 1774176547, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1743877821", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=27-273bd7d9f73b833853d6302a799c7cef.gif,url=https://gxh.vip.qq.com/club/item/parcel/item/27/273bd7d9f73b833853d6302a799c7cef/raw300.gif,key=037bdbf4de28a348,emoji_id=273bd7d9f73b833853d6302a799c7cef,emoji_package_id=235698]"}
{"time": 1774176555, "type": "recv", "message_id": "194303839", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1646108916]“趁现在找个小村落藏起来，隐姓埋名度过后半生”"}
{"time": 1774176655, "type": "recv", "message_id": "830519510", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "吐出嘴里的香烟，稍微整理一下服饰：“继续往前走吧，看看能不能找个地方先歇歇脚”"}
{"time": 1774176718, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1729003954", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=830519510]“先走吧”"}
{"time": 1774176724, "type": "recv", "message_id": "650404728", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "在车里试试能不能找把伞，然后出发。"}
{"time": 1774176730, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1526538382", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=194303839]“我藏起来我小弟咋办”"}
{"time": 1774176756, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1905612855", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“走吧，沿着路走迟早能找到歇脚处的，只是会不会被发现就另说了”"}
{"time": 1774176805, "type": "recv", "message_id": "841732435", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "率先踏出了步伐，走向前面的山路"}
{"time": 1774176829, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1043637264", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1526538382]“人各有命，等到该再见的时候，自然会相见”跟着他走上前方的山路"}
{"time": 1774176872, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2146389592", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "抢来的车，里面没有伞，你们只能冒着雨往前。立秋的夜雨生生浇在身上颇为寒冷，湍急的雨势逐渐变小，转为中雨，在前进不知多久后的一个转弯处，你们突然发现，前方的山路旁竟然停着一辆车。"}
{"time": 1774176910, "type": "recv", "message_id": "395203779", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "过去看看那辆车，车上是否有人？"}
{"time": 1774176990, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1243135398", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "走在路上，聆听雨滴落在信息锅上形成的旋律，随时准备跟着其他人再次抢车"}
{"time": 1774177008, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1793729446", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "（再抢一辆）"}
{"time": 1774177012, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1987035052", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "靠近后，你发现路面的左侧还有一块 1 米高的岩石，不难判断这里是发生了车祸，这块岩石可能自山体坠落到车道上，而这辆黑色桑塔纳躲闪不当，直接撞上了山壁，右侧车灯直接报废，前车窗也出现了如蛛网般的裂纹，车上只有一个司机，已经死亡"}
{"time": 1774177061, "type": "recv", "message_id": "767108302", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（哪个城市啊）"}
