{"time": 1774182033, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1916949569", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "我抱着孩子，去隔壁同样有孩子在哭的房间门口敲门:“喂您好，有人在吗？”"}
{"time": 1774182049, "type": "recv", "message_id": "865305377", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "老板只说不认识这个字，“最近是中元节啊，乡里的人都会来镇上的关帝庙祈福，据说很灵”"}
{"time": 1774182066, "type": "recv", "message_id": "359497115", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "（湖北拜关帝庙吗？（）"}
