{"time": 1774266770, "type": "recv", "message_id": "503883669", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "“他🐎的，没办法，只能在镇上藏一会儿了，走大路出去肯定被查到"}
{"time": 1774266799, "type": "recv", "message_id": "129056244", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "#敲两下板子泄愤"}
