{"time": 1774271374, "type": "recv", "message_id": "65291133", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“好的，谢谢了”拿着诊单朝儿科诊室走去"}
{"time": 1774271487, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1318675918", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "你到了诊室，医生见你头戴个锅进来，感到非常奇异"}
{"time": 1774271559, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1047112867", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "注意到医生的目光:“这是信。。。额，我个人的习惯，不要在意”"}
