{"time": 1774274155, "type": "reply_private", "message_id": "1781535619", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "在演奏厅中[夜鹿夜游真夜中]演奏出: 1D100=35"}
{"time": 1774274190, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1588772865", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "”哎，可惜，一晃眼就不见了“"}
{"time": 1774274216, "type": "recv", "message_id": "806408744", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "“原来，大户人家也信这些”"}
{"time": 1774274252, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1398414967", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "你发现他对这个话题有点感兴趣“什么红衣女童？”"}
{"time": 1774274382, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1756729170", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "（等等[CQ:at,qq=2468514664] 那个绣花鞋她是穿着还是抱着？大小是成人的还是童装？）"}
{"time": 1774274393, "type": "recv", "message_id": "790496311", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1065634063]（）"}
{"time": 1774274397, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1216517962", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "（点错了）"}
{"time": 1774274400, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1349826709", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（抱着，成人鞋"}
{"time": 1774274446, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2142870947", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1398414967]”就，这么高个，抱着双鞋子跑，旁边跟着他爹“"}
{"time": 1774274456, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1177497664", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "#比划个70cm高"}
{"time": 1774274492, "type": "recv", "message_id": "975616616", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "“那双鞋子看起来还真是金贵，估计顶的上我全身行李了”"}
{"time": 1774274510, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1544120738", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "“不过他爹倒是其貌不扬的。看起来比较低调”"}
{"time": 1774274580, "type": "recv", "message_id": "58300849", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "“我记得，鞋舌上好像还绣了什么字……”"}
{"time": 1774274597, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1883552579", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "“是个生僻字，我也不认得”"}
{"time": 1774274635, "type": "recv", "message_id": "391575016", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“什么字啊，你写给我看看？”他叼着烟，从身上掏出一个小本本翻开递给你"}
{"time": 1774274720, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1745925958", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "“那我也没看清啊，只是看着像个荷，包着一个姑”"}
{"time": 1774274896, "type": "recv", "message_id": "165935602", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“你前面说的这么仔细，我还以为你啥都知道呢”"}
{"time": 1774274922, "type": "recv", "message_id": "660314824", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“你在哪见到的这女童和她爹啊，什么时候？”"}
{"time": 1774275001, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2146538176", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "”哎哟，那我得好好想想……“"}
{"time": 1774275075, "type": "recv", "message_id": "286754651", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "”要不这样，兄弟你留个电话给我，我哪天再看见了告诉你“"}
{"time": 1774275134, "type": "recv", "message_id": "953298054", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "”不过嘛，这毕竟是一桩事儿，你瞧，我现在烟都抽不起“"}
{"time": 1774275162, "type": "recv", "message_id": "769398972", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "#拇指摩擦着食指和中指"}
{"time": 1774275291, "type": "recv", "message_id": "285760532", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "男人呵呵笑道“行啊，你电话号码多少啊”"}
