{"time": 1774439825, "type": "recv", "message_id": "426973988", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "#笑笑：“老婆婆，我最近霉运连连，刚算了几卦说我有大凶之兆，走着走着便来到此处。我听闻世界上人有三种死亡：一是肉体上的死去，二是社会身份的丧失，三则是被人所忘记......我突发奇想——倘若我记下这些人的名字，是不是他们并没有彻底的死去？”"}
{"time": 1774439838, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1954848314", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“相似？”"}
{"time": 1774439850, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1863607482", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "#突然又自言自语道：“或许我现在做的只不过是自以为是的宽慰罢了......”"}
{"time": 1774439886, "type": "recv", "message_id": "256981445", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“方才有一个小伙也来找我算了，奇怪的是，你们两人的命数好像在迈向同一个发展方向”"}
{"time": 1774439906, "type": "recv", "message_id": "50173066", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“莫非你们两个其实是熟人？”"}
{"time": 1774439950, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1598308930", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "”奇了，欸先生，你看看这位王兄。他和我也一样吗？“"}
{"time": 1774439974, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1092293772", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“这么蹊跷的吗？看看我的”"}
{"time": 1774439984, "type": "recv", "message_id": "929145768", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "*和他说一下八字"}
{"time": 1774440088, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1326711079", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=426973988]“哈哈，我老了，脑子不灵光，虽然听不是很懂你说的话，但是我也能理解，我的丈夫和孩子在十年前被那场洪灾夺走了，现在在这里当守门的，也只不过是为了天天都能看到他们的墓碑，留个念想......”"}
{"time": 1774440170, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1865906217", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=929145768]这下他的眉头皱得更紧了，“虽然细节上可能会存在偏差，但是大方向上是一样的......”"}
{"time": 1774440190, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1440662474", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“你们果然是一起的吧”"}
{"time": 1774440235, "type": "recv", "message_id": "277774465", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你们果然是一起的吧)"}
{"time": 1774440238, "type": "recv", "message_id": "937319702", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“洪灾啊，天命无常......我也是因为发大水才停在了这个小镇。老婆婆，有你记着他们，想必他们还没有真正的消失，在天上依旧保佑着您嘞。您愿意和我讲讲他们的故事嘛？”#和老婆婆一起往小木屋走去"}
{"time": 1774440256, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1409733187", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "看到他的神情，感觉到意思不妥：“我们不是有什么坏事要发生吧”"}
{"time": 1774440338, "type": "recv", "message_id": "184213696", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=937319702]你和老婆婆在小屋坐下，小屋虽然简陋，但是却给你一种温馨的感觉，婆婆给你泡了一杯茶，开始讲起以前的故事"}
{"time": 1774440393, "type": "recv", "message_id": "304281395", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "#洗耳待听"}
{"time": 1774440489, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1799580246", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“十年前我们野荷塘正在飞速发展中，镇长周怀民管理有方，带动了不少咱们镇里的百姓致富，他儿子周茂开的药材加工厂也招了很多没有工作的年轻人，让他们有事做”"}
{"time": 1774440523, "type": "recv", "message_id": "384282517", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“我老伴当年给药材厂当保安的，天天跟我夸他们父子两呢”"}
{"time": 1774440597, "type": "recv", "message_id": "834691542", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“可惜十年前那场超大暴雨引发了洪灾，把一切都毁了，周镇长在抗洪中牺牲，他儿子的药材厂也没了，我老伴也在洪水中丢了性命”"}
{"time": 1774440663, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1754575911", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“那个厂是金茂厂嘛？”#好奇"}
{"time": 1774440668, "type": "recv", "message_id": "872345518", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“我们野荷塘就像是将开的荷花，被人从杆拦腰砍断啊”"}
{"time": 1774440696, "type": "recv", "message_id": "668062903", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“如今年轻人越来越少，只剩下我们这种老东西还留在这破镇子喽”"}
{"time": 1774440741, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1085295886", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1409733187]“命数表明，你们几人的身边有一个不妙的因素，会致使祸端”"}
{"time": 1774440763, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2127019474", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“至于是什么，我只有见到了才知道”"}
{"time": 1774440793, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1789848330", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“刚才收过了前面那个小伙的钱，就不收你们的了”"}
{"time": 1774440805, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1888976119", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1754575911]“对对，金茂”"}
{"time": 1774440814, "type": "recv", "message_id": "338524658", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2127019474]（估计得等我到了？）"}
{"time": 1774440829, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2133529463", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1789848330]”那就谢先生指点了“"}
{"time": 1774440839, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1442182538", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2127019474]“请问大师，有规避的方法吗”"}
{"time": 1774440860, "type": "recv", "message_id": "284783947", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“还好周茂争气，近几年又开了个新厂，总算又拉回了点年轻人”"}
{"time": 1774440877, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1019603418", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（我服了）"}
