{"time": 1774441772, "type": "recv", "message_id": "65714946", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "“你……哎，小心点，这边到处都是金茂的人，保不齐走漏风声。“"}
