{"time": 1774441886, "type": "recv", "message_id": "336432867", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "“你还记得之前那个中山装老板吗？他也是金茂的人”"}
