{"time": 1774442022, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1301049162", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“还有什么想说的吗？没有的话，我就进庙里去烧柱香，为这小孩祈福了”"}
{"time": 1774442051, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1035998584", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1038982357]“我的话，就找治病的法子吧”"}
