{"time": 1774442187, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2130841102", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“你们喜欢叫啥就叫啥”"}
{"time": 1774442190, "type": "recv", "message_id": "429558889", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "”叫倪小妹挺不错“"}
{"time": 1774442204, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1112756908", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“叫徐小舟”"}
{"time": 1774442263, "type": "recv", "message_id": "498269240", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=891879298]”我觉得倪小妹不错，叫徐小舟的话，保不齐长大了也得顶个锅盖“"}
{"time": 1774442305, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1920497067", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "”倪小妹，学名倪晓梅吧“"}
{"time": 1774442336, "type": "recv", "message_id": "819009733", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "#抱着小孩往后退两步:“要不叫徐晓梅”"}
{"time": 1774442372, "type": "recv", "message_id": "254101816", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=819009733]”……好好，依你依你“"}
{"time": 1774442378, "type": "recv", "message_id": "668717024", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“也算我的功德，以后菩萨也好记我一笔”"}
{"time": 1774442386, "type": "recv", "message_id": "587159742", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "#想了想”要不还是让她姓何吧，说不定人家原本就姓这个呢？“"}
{"time": 1774442397, "type": "recv", "message_id": "433844122", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "#拱完火后打算继续去找线索”我打算再去典当铺和茶楼问问，晚上再回旅馆“"}
{"time": 1774442429, "type": "recv", "message_id": "995997520", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=587159742]”别了吧，谁家小孩不跟着养父母姓，生父母还不知道在哪儿呢“"}
{"time": 1774442497, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1522943647", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "#去17看看"}
{"time": 1774442499, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2073596511", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“我给晓梅祈福完，打算去给她采几朵莲花”"}
{"time": 1774442512, "type": "recv", "message_id": "502550030", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=668717024]”哦对，徐舟，你记得待会儿去那边那个胖先生那里看看“"}
{"time": 1774442526, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1929302454", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "”说不定他能看出点什么。“"}
{"time": 1774442529, "type": "recv", "message_id": "282058503", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“嗯？为什么？”"}
{"time": 1774442538, "type": "recv", "message_id": "724937077", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=282058503]“直觉”"}
{"time": 1774442552, "type": "recv", "message_id": "671218171", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "”我们仨都在他哪儿算过“"}
{"time": 1774442557, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2058231906", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "”一个卦象“"}
{"time": 1774442565, "type": "recv", "message_id": "488974740", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "点点头"}
{"time": 1774442566, "type": "recv", "message_id": "581182085", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1522943647]（你这个行动没有确切的理由）"}
{"time": 1774442581, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1926149707", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（你是因为知道那里有个点才去的（）"}
{"time": 1774442584, "type": "recv", "message_id": "7240121", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "#一脸不爽地看着杨秀全“不行，你都不信我的气功和信息锅，你怎么就信上路边算命先生的卦了”"}
{"time": 1774442585, "type": "recv", "message_id": "165462946", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“不过其实吧，我觉得也不用去了。猜大家都是一样的。”"}
{"time": 1774442609, "type": "recv", "message_id": "178361052", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=7240121]“跟你走了这么久，没看到你的什么气功灵验过”"}
{"time": 1774442615, "type": "recv", "message_id": "964601890", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1926149707]（你可以换一个说法）"}
{"time": 1774442616, "type": "recv", "message_id": "897493476", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "敲敲徐舟的铁桶，“这东西能挡住发黑的印堂吗”"}
{"time": 1774442627, "type": "recv", "message_id": "714981112", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "#那就往回走，看看有什么建筑"}
{"time": 1774442632, "type": "recv", "message_id": "421799740", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=178361052]“那是。。。那是我舟车劳顿，修行环境不好，功法下降了”"}
{"time": 1774442648, "type": "recv", "message_id": "665475789", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "气急败坏地找借口反驳"}
{"time": 1774442654, "type": "recv", "message_id": "307031379", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=165462946]“我觉得不太一样。和那些江湖人士相比，他竟然没有贪图我和王兄的钱财”"}
{"time": 1774442667, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1075701936", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "”感觉是有点手段“"}
{"time": 1774442671, "type": "recv", "message_id": "572598539", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“我其实也不怎么信这些的”"}
{"time": 1774442688, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1589356648", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“但他能看出来我们都是一起的，就有点神奇”"}
{"time": 1774442696, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1478498266", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“也不排除之前看到我们走在一起就是了”"}
{"time": 1774442700, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1110316402", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=421799740]”好好好，我也只是建议，就这样吧，我们继续探镇子去了。“"}
{"time": 1774442714, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1433925690", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=714981112]（哪个回）"}
{"time": 1774442722, "type": "recv", "message_id": "864268235", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“如果他说的是真，还是得找找应对方法的”叹口气"}
{"time": 1774442726, "type": "recv", "message_id": "848442938", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（你画一个路线给我）"}
{"time": 1774442744, "type": "recv", "message_id": "535377738", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“徐兄你照顾好孩子，我也先在小镇再逛逛了”"}
{"time": 1774442769, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2078565483", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=421799740]”此外，晚上不要回那家旅店了，到时候你在附近找找，可以找到一家小陈旅店，我们今晚在那儿住“"}
{"time": 1774442823, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1775586714", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "”就这样“"}
{"time": 1774442846, "type": "recv", "message_id": "634640411", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "#离开，沿着水边往回走"}
{"time": 1774442862, "type": "recv", "message_id": "956934779", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“倪兄怎么说，要一起吗”"}
{"time": 1774442867, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1005959719", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（还没走吧）"}
{"time": 1774442868, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1429025900", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（他）"}
{"time": 1774442871, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1950146435", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2078565483]“那就到时候再见了，哦，今晚那个旅店可能有抓奸看，我到时候会去看看热闹”"}
