{"time": 1774443537, "type": "recv", "message_id": "4941824", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（彳亍）"}
{"time": 1774443564, "type": "recv", "message_id": "870733924", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "”有兴趣和我讲讲你的故事嘛？我听看守墓地的老婆婆说过这里10年前遇过洪灾，和我讲讲你的故事，回答我一些问题，我请你吃饭。“"}
{"time": 1774443611, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1242034773", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1680431455]#被羞辱后，痛苦地捂住胸口:“确实，我这一年来修炼不精，已经堕落到这种地步了”"}
{"time": 1774443639, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1683521310", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“呵呵，还有这种好事？”"}
{"time": 1774443677, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1345934177", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“算了，不扯我的事了”#将怀中的晓梅展示出来，“你能看看这孩子的状况，是沾染了什么邪祟吗？”"}
{"time": 1774443735, "type": "recv", "message_id": "446478983", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“解厄5块钱”"}
{"time": 1774443791, "type": "recv", "message_id": "724565334", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "他看了看孩子，说道“这孩子是中邪了”"}
{"time": 1774443806, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1414026197", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“好便宜，北京那边的算命师傅都收50一次的”#掏钱付款，“不许坐地起价”"}
{"time": 1774443814, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1508560386", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "。st money-5"}
{"time": 1774443814, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1508560386", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[徐舟]的人物卡已更新:\n[MONEY]: 15-5=10"}
{"time": 1774443833, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1407244426", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“这是迷魂之症，小孩子1岁时正是聚魂固魄的年纪，此时最易沾染邪祟，一旦受某些脏东西的侵扰，魂魄被迷住，迟迟无法聚成，迟早有一天孩子会魂飞魄散，瞧你们孩子的模样，丢命也就是这十天半个月的事了。”"}
{"time": 1774443908, "type": "recv", "message_id": "697218887", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1407244426]“迷魂之症？你可以解决吗？还是需要请送子娘娘或者观音菩萨之类的神仙？”"}
{"time": 1774443929, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2108687887", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=870733924]“我以前是金茂加工厂的员工，10年前的洪灾让许多人都在那场灾难中丧命，我的老伴和外孙也不例外，我的儿子被抢救回来了，但却重病在医院内”"}
{"time": 1774443967, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1713821701", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“我花光积蓄也没能救回来，，以至于沦落到现在这样，其实现在镇子里有许多人跟我一样，家人因那场洪灾死的死散的散，而到自己这个岁数的，身边没有亲人跟等死没什么区别，唯一的意义也就是每年的中元节的时候，我能去讨点纸钱”"}
{"time": 1774443976, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1913286087", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“我总觉我的老伴还有我的孩子都在那片荷塘里，他们躲在荷叶底下偷偷看着我，又不肯出来，等着我下去。”"}
{"time": 1774444087, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1156188819", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“应该是中了水鬼的邪，在我们这地方，最多便是那水鬼，因为有重男轻女的恶习。你可以回家用那碗中立筷的法子试着打发看看”，他将一道黄符交给你，“用此符可以化解”"}
{"time": 1774444097, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1452537740", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“这段时间荷塘里有发生过什么怪事嘛？”"}
{"time": 1774444105, "type": "recv", "message_id": "940316067", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=95982907D2665098087F7ABC6792DF99.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQrsQEcBdJt_OL07P49ILnX85Ls7xjd3Qog_woo-q-ctI-7kwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQGSldk8QBo19c0-PvpHNuznoCmVSCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAQSMAperC7e54lgk8AovZdK_tsMeYWBRCcnepNfEQu83uPjz2KvmyCuXgQXlSJuk9lCgQ,file_size=175837]"}
