{"time": 1774444675, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2092297189", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "（你问问女婴上的文青是用来干嘛的？）"}
{"time": 1774444683, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1586667780", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "（好，我问问）"}
{"time": 1774444709, "type": "recv", "message_id": "8070220", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“你们几人的卦象都是一样的，命里有一劫，就在最近了”"}
{"time": 1774444732, "type": "recv", "message_id": "732372573", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“我看原因就和这女娃有关了”"}
{"time": 1774444769, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2116022058", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“这女娃并非你们几个亲生吧？我想四个大老爷们带个女娃也是古怪”"}
{"time": 1774444791, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1549793217", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“先生真有些本事，对了，关于这她的事”#靠近一点，让他看看晓梅背上的文青，“你看这文青是做什么用的？还有他的鞋上也有荷花与荷仙姑的要素”"}
{"time": 1774444836, "type": "recv", "message_id": "56050581", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2116022058]“确实如此，只是希望先生不要声张，若是能找到孩子的生父母，我们自然会带她回家”"}
{"time": 1774444964, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1571925572", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“这鞋上是个“讳字”，直呼神灵的全名是被视为不敬的，所以会用字符来指代，这种字符常用于做法和画符，但是这个字并不属于任何一个正统神灵啊……”"}
{"time": 1774445011, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1641126625", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "（这次会被攻哈吗）"}
{"time": 1774445028, "type": "recv", "message_id": "658627514", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“荷仙姑……看起来像是什么野神……”"}
{"time": 1774445039, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1853519243", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“嗯？难道不是八仙过海那个吗？”"}
{"time": 1774445108, "type": "recv", "message_id": "780806324", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“孩子背后的刺青也一样，看起来像道教的符篆，但是结构完全不同”"}
{"time": 1774445149, "type": "recv", "message_id": "245506215", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“该符的符头并不是代表正统道教三清的三点，而是一个象形的“水”。字，与“奉”字相连，所请的神明为“荷仙姑”，何字写错了，且所请的事项写着“刍牲”二字，刍意为用草编织而成，牲代表猪鸭牛羊等牲畜，二字联合起来意指用草编织成的牲畜，常规符咒中从未见过有此事项”"}
{"time": 1774445203, "type": "recv", "message_id": "97008981", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“这孩子要被当作祭祀用的牲畜......”"}
{"time": 1774445220, "type": "recv", "message_id": "283476847", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1853519243]“并不是”"}
{"time": 1774445242, "type": "recv", "message_id": "660071972", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“会不会是假冒何仙姑，以欺骗信徒的伪神。。。”\n#说一半突然想起了妙峰山的事"}
{"time": 1774445275, "type": "recv", "message_id": "710724686", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "（伪作的神王）"}
{"time": 1774445283, "type": "recv", "message_id": "83472920", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（神了"}
{"time": 1774445290, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1332418408", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（塘边还有动作吗"}
{"time": 1774445317, "type": "recv", "message_id": "685456454", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=660071972]“只怕是哪个精怪假扮的”"}
{"time": 1774445321, "type": "recv", "message_id": "474192946", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=97008981]“祭祀用的人畜？竟然如此。。。”"}
{"time": 1774445341, "type": "recv", "message_id": "144801616", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“这孩子到底是什么来历？”"}
{"time": 1774445359, "type": "recv", "message_id": "189973093", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "（等这边先过了吧）"}
{"time": 1774445417, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2084470673", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=144801616]贴近他身边，轻声说:“疑似和金茂相关，你是本地人吗？有没有什么头绪？”"}
{"time": 1774445443, "type": "recv", "message_id": "573610027", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "胖先生摇摇头"}
{"time": 1774445586, "type": "recv", "message_id": "863807262", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“你以前在金茂加工厂工作，周怀民和他儿子是怎么样的人？你现在还在金茂工厂工作吗？”"}
{"time": 1774445611, "type": "recv", "message_id": "205616722", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=573610027]#犹豫了一会，但还是问出口:“对了，先生，你，听说过妙峰山的事吗？\n如果，只是如果，邪教或是骗局的信徒，也一路行正义之事，也能步入正道吗？”"}
{"time": 1774445717, "type": "recv", "message_id": "427231875", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“他们两父子对我们老百姓是真的好，虽然周怀民在当年抗洪时牺牲了，但是如今的周茂也算是继承了他的遗志了”"}
{"time": 1774445928, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2003584456", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=205616722]“妙峰山？从没听说过，估计也是和那荷仙姑一样的假货吧。浪子回头金不换，你现在扔了你头上的锅也还不迟”"}
{"time": 1774446007, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1724326617", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2003584456]“嗯，嗯”#敷衍着点点头，并不打算摘下头顶的锅“谢谢先生了，有缘再见”"}
{"time": 1774446018, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1872879258", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "（大结局或者结团之前不可能扔的）"}
