{"time": 1775041589, "type": "recv", "message_id": "703010644", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "1是一个三层高的旅馆，叫野荷旅馆"}
{"time": 1775041628, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1768363699", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "（要不今晚就住这？离金茂远点）"}
{"time": 1775041641, "type": "recv", "message_id": "961673470", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "连叶冰"}, "message": "（本来我们就打算换个旅馆的）"}
{"time": 1775041660, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1136971863", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=808475895]“对啊，后天就是中元会了，得抓紧准备才行”"}
{"time": 1775041737, "type": "recv", "message_id": "464225356", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "道长撸了撸长袖，继续说道“你看我们还找了其他庙宇道观的人来帮忙呢”"}
{"time": 1775041768, "type": "recv", "message_id": "70205006", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "连叶冰"}, "message": "“今晚要不我们就住这边吧，杨兄也说，那个旅馆不太对劲”"}
{"time": 1775041790, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1684010180", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "（盲猜其他人里有邪教徒。jpg）"}
{"time": 1775041798, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1086858028", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "连叶冰"}, "message": "（盲猜其他人里有邪教徒。jpg）"}
{"time": 1775041800, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1772008880", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "“倒是也行”"}
{"time": 1775041804, "type": "recv", "message_id": "810172871", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=464225356]“这么热闹？他们都是附近村镇的庙宇道观吗？”"}
{"time": 1775041842, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1557791280", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "连叶冰"}, "message": "“昨晚入住的时候，我也感觉到有人在监视我们...虽然也不排除现在也有，不过换个环境可能好一些”"}
{"time": 1775041907, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1396354300", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“对对，我们关帝庙算是最有名的，来的人比较多，事务比较多，就让他们来帮把手”"}
{"time": 1775042011, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1548088153", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "＃进入野荷旅馆，问问还有没有空房间"}
{"time": 1775042032, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1950529931", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“这几天又是暴雨又是泥石流什么的，道长们不好回去吧，道长们都是在镇子里的旅馆住宿吗？”"}
{"time": 1775042223, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1047683594", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1548088153]有的兄弟，有的"}
{"time": 1775042268, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1693610422", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1950529931]“这后面有厢房，平时是只有咱们关帝庙的人住，现在人多，五个人一起住一间”"}
{"time": 1775042327, "type": "recv", "message_id": "248535660", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "连叶冰"}, "message": "*问问价格"}
{"time": 1775042347, "type": "recv", "message_id": "311603949", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "连叶冰"}, "message": "“价格怎么样？”走去前台"}
{"time": 1775042411, "type": "recv", "message_id": "590225646", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“就是正殿后面那四个厢房是吧，看着挺简陋，没想到能住那么多人”"}
{"time": 1775042458, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2062202041", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "前台是一个看起来就很八卦的中年大妈，边嗑瓜子边回复“单人间16，双人间28”"}
{"time": 1775042484, "type": "recv", "message_id": "442869431", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "连叶冰"}, "message": "（之前那个旅馆）"}
{"time": 1775042491, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1764002865", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "连叶冰"}, "message": "（好像便宜点）"}
