{"time": 1775043813, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1142159458", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“求子，三太子？”#看看这件道服有没有标记主人，在衣柜里翻翻其他道服，找找有没有类似的纸条"}
{"time": 1775043862, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1479180257", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "这道服上面标记了这件衣服属于一个叫“云清”的道长，其他倒是没有这种东西"}
{"time": 1775044005, "type": "recv", "message_id": "757217870", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "#把纸条塞回道服，整理好衣柜，装作无事发生"}
{"time": 1775044055, "type": "recv", "message_id": "779594077", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "＃那么在走之前突然记起来自己原本决定去旅馆等待的理由“现在时间不早了，就算再去关帝庙的话我想还是不太来得及…还是回旅馆等吧，保险一些。”"}
{"time": 1775044061, "type": "recv", "message_id": "452800205", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“三太子？哪吒？或者又是假冒的精怪？不过正规寺庙，暂且信他是个正道”"}
{"time": 1775044095, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1154135958", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "连叶冰"}, "message": "“也好吧，”看看外面是天空，“时间确实不早了”"}
{"time": 1775044151, "type": "recv", "message_id": "243165509", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=452800205]“硬要说的话，这哪吒与荷花的关系也不浅，这野荷塘可真热闹，快比上妙峰山了”"}
{"time": 1775044158, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1768510166", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "＃前往小陈旅馆"}
