{"time": 1775044267, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1197780110", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "#抱着孩子离开厢房，回到左偏殿"}
{"time": 1775044340, "type": "recv", "message_id": "605327311", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "找刚刚和我聊天的道长打听:“我听说云清道长也来关帝庙帮忙了？”"}
{"time": 1775044377, "type": "recv", "message_id": "337211986", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“你认识他？”"}
{"time": 1775044424, "type": "recv", "message_id": "27307383", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "指了指裹在孩子身上的道服:“同道中人嘛，最近俗事缠身，不然我也要来帮忙筹备庙会的”"}
{"time": 1775044476, "type": "recv", "message_id": "905193998", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“只是在外地听人说起过他的名字，还没见过本人”"}
{"time": 1775044528, "type": "recv", "message_id": "725632636", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“他是乡里的道观来的，你居然还听过他的名字，真稀奇”道长随口说道"}
{"time": 1775044726, "type": "recv", "message_id": "716808884", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“山不在高，有仙则名，道长也别把名声看的太重，无论那位乡下来的道长在不在场，说这些话也伤人自尊嘛。”"}
{"time": 1775044872, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1908129199", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“所以云清道长现在是出庙了吗？”"}
{"time": 1775044898, "type": "recv", "message_id": "956552335", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“确实，他现在不在庙里”"}
{"time": 1775044954, "type": "recv", "message_id": "916897975", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“不帮忙筹备庙会吗？是出什么要紧事了？”"}
{"time": 1775045000, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1775577658", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“他去采买东西了”"}
{"time": 1775045117, "type": "recv", "message_id": "946319189", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“既然不在庙里，那我就不叨扰他了，再见道长”#离开左偏殿"}
{"time": 1775045130, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1935198949", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "#确认一下目前的时间"}
