{"time": 1775045481, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1947306896", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（警察：来活了）"}
{"time": 1775045484, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1953519128", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "路过派出所时快步走过，不久留，继续南下（8）"}
{"time": 1775045519, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1808662655", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "（倪雨路过了）"}
{"time": 1775045546, "type": "recv", "message_id": "556039659", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "你来到谭家茶楼，这栋二层高的小楼全楼上下由古朴的黑木构架而成，从门到窗皆备古镇风范的装修，屋檐悬挂着的红灯笼随风轻摇着，摇出一阵阵茶香。茶楼门口立着的一块木牌上面写着，在8.10和8.11这两天的晚上20:00-21:00，茶楼将会出演傩戏"}
{"time": 1775045566, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1275780092", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "也就是明后两天"}
{"time": 1775045601, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1012039144", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "站在门口朝里观望，看看有没有人"}
{"time": 1775045663, "type": "recv", "message_id": "48158348", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "一眼望去，有许多茶客在这里喝茶吹水"}
{"time": 1775045676, "type": "recv", "message_id": "976926475", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "。st show money"}
{"time": 1775045676, "type": "reply", "message_id": "976926475", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[徐舟]的[MONEY]: 10"}
{"time": 1775045699, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1356240480", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "也巧，还有最后一点闲钱，进去喝两杯"}
{"time": 1775045797, "type": "recv", "message_id": "75272577", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "见你进来坐下，店小二立马来接待你，虽然对你头上的锅感到一样，但还是很有职业素养地向你推销起了他们的特色古茶“莲心玉露茶”"}
{"time": 1775045805, "type": "recv", "message_id": "189689443", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（异样）"}
{"time": 1775045831, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1119570284", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“我们这莲心玉露茶啊，七块钱一壶，一壶就能坐一下午”"}
{"time": 1775045851, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2005565191", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“将恩施玉露加野荷塘的莲子心调配蒸煮，茶香扑鼻，入口苦后回甘，沁人心脾。”"}
{"time": 1775045876, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1525630127", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "仿佛贯口一般的广告词不断从他嘴里吐出"}
{"time": 1775045924, "type": "recv", "message_id": "282129895", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "已经习惯别人对我的异样眼神，淡然回复:“你这么能说会道，这茶有什么历史吗？我只喝有历史典故的名茶”"}
{"time": 1775045991, "type": "recv", "message_id": "268206275", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“呃......这个茶是唐朝时期的大茶客来到我们这里以后研发出来的”"}
{"time": 1775046084, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1711113945", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（陆羽.jpg）"}
{"time": 1775046170, "type": "recv", "message_id": "37923309", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“行了行了，编不出来就不用编了”不打趣店小二了，“你卖一壶茶能赚多少啊？过几天我老带新，给你加点业绩，这壶茶给我算便宜点行不？”"}
{"time": 1775046242, "type": "recv", "message_id": "59962677", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“哈哈，客官您说笑了，我们这一直是卖这个价的，你现在砍价了，我们对不起那些老茶客了”"}
{"time": 1775046339, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2035895616", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“这茶楼经营了不少年嘛，当年的洪灾没影响吗？”"}
{"time": 1775046380, "type": "recv", "message_id": "743172085", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“这茶楼经营了不少年嘛，你在这干了多久活了？”"}
{"time": 1775046496, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2017043158", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“我干了三四年吧”"}
